WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:06.806
Meta Neural Band lets you

00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:10.577
control Meta Ray-Ban Display
by making gestures with your hand.

00:00:11.478 --> 00:00:15.415
Meta Neural Band works by interpreting the signals
created by your muscle activity

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:17.317
when you make certain gestures.

00:00:17.317 --> 00:00:21.388
The fit of Meta Neural Band is different
from other wristbands and watches.

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:24.691
In order to function properly,
it's important that you wear

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:27.060
Meta Neural Band correctly.

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.496
Wear on your writing hand.

00:00:29.496 --> 00:00:32.632
The line on the band faces you,
and the compute module is on the top of

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:34.634
your wrist.

00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:38.972
Position is just past your wristbone.

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:43.476
The band is secured snug and comfortably

00:00:43.476 --> 00:00:46.212
so that all the sensors have contact
with your skin.

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:47.847
With the clasp closed.

00:00:58.992 --> 00:01:01.861
If you're having trouble
getting gestures to work with your band,

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:05.098
check to make sure you're wearing the band
correctly and that it's the right fit.

00:01:05.999 --> 00:01:10.270
For more information, you can watch
our video How to Wear Meta Neural Band.

00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:14.641
Make sure that 
Meta Neural Band is turned on.

00:01:14.641 --> 00:01:20.213
To turn on the band, press and hold the power button
for 1 to 2 seconds, until the LED slowly

00:01:20.213 --> 00:01:22.015
pulses white and the band vibrates.

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:25.618
When your band is worn correctly,

00:01:25.618 --> 00:01:29.456
you can perform gestures with your hand
resting by your side or on your lap.

00:01:29.456 --> 00:01:31.224
You do not need to hold your arm out

00:01:31.224 --> 00:01:33.726
to have your Meta Neural Band 
interpret your gestures.

00:01:34.194 --> 00:01:37.230
Let's take a look at what you can do
with gestures on your Meta Neural Band.

00:01:38.031 --> 00:01:40.533
To wake or sleep your glasses

00:01:40.533 --> 00:01:43.937
double tap your 
middle finger on your thumb.

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:49.676
To scroll,

00:01:49.676 --> 00:01:51.044
swipe your thumb on your index finger,

00:01:51.044 --> 00:01:52.846
just like swiping on a phone.

00:01:56.783 --> 00:01:57.917
To select, 

00:01:57.917 --> 00:01:59.686
tap your index finger on your thumb.

00:02:00.153 --> 00:02:03.022
To go back, tap your 
middle finger on your thumb.

00:02:05.058 --> 00:02:05.725
To zoom in

00:02:05.725 --> 00:02:08.695
or out in the Capture,
Photos, and Maps apps,

00:02:08.695 --> 00:02:12.365
you can do an index finger hold and turn
just like turning a knob.

00:02:12.365 --> 00:02:15.502
Index finger hold
and turn your wrist right to zoom in.

00:02:15.502 --> 00:02:18.271
Index finger hold and turn your wrist left

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:19.772
to zoom out.

00:02:21.574 --> 00:02:22.775
To adjust volume

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:26.279
index finger hold and turn your wrist
right to increase the volume.

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:30.216
Index finger hold and turn your wrist 
left to decrease the volume.

00:02:33.086 --> 00:02:35.388
To activate or exit Meta AI,

00:02:35.388 --> 00:02:38.024
double tap your thumb
on the side of your index finger

00:02:39.592 --> 00:02:41.060
While in an app

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:42.595
to open or close the switcher,

00:02:42.595 --> 00:02:44.397
hold your middle finger to your thumb.

00:02:44.397 --> 00:02:47.467
This is your shortcut
to access the switcher from any app.

00:02:51.237 --> 00:02:53.806
If you're having trouble
getting a gesture to work, 

00:02:53.806 --> 00:02:56.876
check if you are wearing the band correctly
and are in a relaxed position.

00:03:02.315 --> 00:03:03.483
If you are still having trouble,

00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:07.320
 try doing the gesture
a little faster and more precisely.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:09.822
You should feel haptics
when performing a gesture.

00:03:10.557 --> 00:03:12.859
To learn more about Meta Neural Band gestures,

00:03:12.859 --> 00:03:16.462
visit the gestures library in the Meta AI
mobile app.

00:03:17.197 --> 00:03:21.434
For more videos and information about using 
Meta Ray-Ban Display and Meta Neural Band,

00:03:21.434 --> 00:03:26.039
visit the Getting Started hub by scanning
the QR code on the reference guide.

00:03:26.039 --> 00:03:30.143
You can also visit our Help Center to
learn more or contact Meta Store support.

